        "text": "={{ $json[\"How would you like to rebalance your portfolio?\"] }}\n\nIn order to achieve this:\n1. Read in the portfolio from the sheet\n2. Fetch latest prices of the positions\n3. Update the table with the prices\n4. Make decisions on portfolio rebalancing\n5. Update the table with the portfolio relabalncing decisions\n6. Read the table again to check the rebalancing achieved the objectives\n7. Make any further changes to improve the rebalancing, updating the table\n8. Finally send an email with the trading decisions and a concise push notification\n",
